flowchart TD
    A[Main Agent @ Frame 5] --> B{Identify Attack Surfaces}
    B --> C[Clone A: Surface 1]
    B --> D[Clone B: Surface 2]
    B --> E[Clone C: Surface 3]
    
    C --> F[Explore & Test]
    D --> G[Explore & Test]
    E --> H[Explore & Test]
    
    F --> I[Summary A]
    G --> J[Summary B]
    H --> K[Summary C]
    
    I --> L[Merge into Main Context]
    J --> L
    K --> L
    
    L --> M[Main Agent @ Frame 6<br/>Contains all summaries]